Third-party assets

The MIT License above covers the source code, stylesheet, logo and icons. The
bundled media keeps its own licence:

- Music in src/main/resources/com/example/billard/music/: tracks by
  Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com), Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). See the README.md in that
  folder for the credit that every build must show.
- Sound effects in src/main/resources/com/example/billard/sounds/: recordings
  from Freesound released under CC0 1.0 (public domain). See the README.md in
  that folder for each source.
